              "instructions": "Find the URL of the latest NUCC Provider Taxonomy CSV file. Rules: (a) Look for the CSV file (filename ends with .csv) that contains the current taxonomy code set; the file usually has a name like `nucc_taxonomy_<version>.csv`. (b) If multiple versions are listed, return the URL of the most recent one. (c) IGNORE PDF, XLSX, and ZIP files -- only the CSV is the data file we want. (d) Return only the absolute URL."
            }
          },
          "file_format": "csv",
          "staging_name": "PublicStaging.StagingNucc",
          "public_data_name": "PipelinePublicHealthData.Nucc"
